      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that, it's a solid start. i think the technical details are good. \n\ni'm looking at the system logs for this draft and the score came back a bit lower than i'd like, probably because it's a little on the short side for the library's standards. i need the students to really sit with the concept, so having more text to read through helps them engage with it.\n\ncan you expand on this? specifically, dive deeper into the mathematical derivation from the wave packet perspective and maybe discuss the implications for the energy-time uncertainty relation as well. again, please make sure it's actually meaningful information and not just fluff, but i really need that length to increase to get it through the filter.",
